<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>When using the TaSCAN with the IG OFF, repeatedly turn any door courtesy light switch ON / OFF (at intervals of 1.5 seconds or less) until communication between the TaSCAN and the vehicle starts.</ptxt>
</atten3>
